      "path": "cordis.patch.yml",
      "text": "# Bundle patch for dsh-mcp-hub.\n#\n# Once the package is listed in the profile's `dsh.profile.bundles`, this insert\n# row mounts the plugin in the loader tree.\n#\n# ── id 命名规则（上个插件踩过坑，这里写死成约定）────────────────────────────\n# Loader entries are addressed by **id**, and the profile patch layer is applied\n# AFTER the bundle layers, so a duplicate id makes the profile row silently\n# replace the bundle row — the plugin then never activates while everything\n# around it keeps working.\n#\n#   this plugin's own bundle id .......... mcp-hub\n#   every row this page generates ........ mcp-hub__<serverName>\n#\n# The `mcp-hub__` namespace makes a collision structurally impossible: a user\n# cannot name a server such that its generated id equals a bundle id.\n- insert:\n    - id: mcp-hub\n      name: dsh-mcp-hub\n"
    }
